      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2015 FDI World Dental Federation.",
        "AbstractText": [
          {
            "NlmCategory": "BACKGROUND",
            "Label": "CONTEXT",
            "content": "Self-care is one of the ways in which people without access to professional care can actively engage in managing their oral health problems."
          },
          {
            "NlmCategory": "OBJECTIVE",
            "Label": "AIM",
            "content": "To find out the prevalence of dental pain and the type of self-care remedies utilised for pain relief by people with low socio-economic status residing in Kollipara mandal, Guntur district, Andhra Pradesh."
          },
          {
            "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
            "Label": "SETTINGS AND DESIGN",
            "content": "This was a cross-sectional population-based study."
          },
          {
            "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
            "Label": "METHODS AND MATERIAL",
            "content": "A multistage simple random-sampling technique was adopted to obtain an appropriate sample. A questionnaire, which consisted of sections on socio-economic and demographic variables, dental pain, pain characteristics and self-care remedies utilised to combat dental pain, was used to collect data. Statistical analysis used the chi-square test and descriptive statistics."
          },
          {
            "NlmCategory": "RESULTS",
            "Label": "RESULTS",
            "content": "The survey covered a total population of 630 individuals. The mean age of the population was 32.8±16.7 years. Among the total study subjects, 44.1% were male and 55.9% were female. The prevalence of dental pain reported during the preceding 6 months was 28.3%. Subjects who experienced dental pain reported the home remedies and self-care methods that they utilised to get relief from the pain. They more frequently reported using over-the-counter medication (49.6%) for pain relief."
          },
          {
            "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
            "Label": "CONCLUSIONS",
            "content": "This study provides an insight into the type and usage of self-care in relief of dental pain. Pain sufferers used a variety of self-care methods to deal with their problems."
          }
        ]
      },
